  "description": "Official OpenRouter Chat Completions + model catalog on the v2 agent model contract (INPUT llm_input → OUTPUT llm_output). operation selects chat (POST /api/v1/chat/completions) or list_models (GET /api/v1/models). Auth is StudioQuack secret api_key sent as Bearer. Routes to third-party models — customer accepts upstream ToS per model. Docs: https://openrouter.ai/docs/api-reference/overview. Terms: https://openrouter.ai/terms. Never log api_key.",
  "icon": "psychology",
  "tags": [
    "openrouter",
    "ai"
